 the Dreadnought in the right hand (Patch 7, item 30).\n\nCut from `archfiend.bbmodel` as made, no redraw: the grip is at the origin with an empty `slot_grip` there, under `root`, and the piece points along -Z from the grip.\n\nReview fix (Patch 7 weapons review): the `greatsword` group rolled 90 about Z (its own length) at the grip, so the cross-guard no longer sits inside his right bracer in `attack_smash` and `attack_swing`; the edge now leads the smash and the flat leads the swing; cubes unchanged.\n\n- Clips: `attack_smash`, `attack_swing`.\n- Length: 204 cm.\n- Cubes: 7.\n- Texture: 256x256, the monster's own sheet cropped to the faces used."}